{"method":{"methodHash":"3a7a355d4d77c36638c23e4e0031bbcf","typeHash":"b81c0d0390b2627546ac203aadc9f4c4","name":"FindThemedChildren","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/Other/ThemeManager.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":707,"startColumn":9,"endLine":744,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":711,"startColumn":30,"endLine":711,"endColumn":71},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"GetChildrenCount"},{"span":{"startLine":714,"startColumn":29,"endLine":714,"endColumn":65},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"GetChild"},{"span":{"startLine":719,"startColumn":41,"endLine":719,"endColumn":67},"calleeMethodHash":"789088b24d6db0ca95a4f1de86f6dac9","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.Theme.ThemeBehavior.GetTheme(DependencyObject)"},{"span":{"startLine":720,"startColumn":26,"endLine":720,"endColumn":58},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"IsNullOrEmpty"},{"span":{"startLine":722,"startColumn":25,"endLine":727,"endColumn":27},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Add"},{"span":{"startLine":725,"startColumn":44,"endLine":725,"endColumn":78},"calleeMethodHash":"a70125d9ddb4a125c948c954bd0526a3","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.Theme.ThemeManager.GetPropertyPathFromTag(string)"},{"span":{"startLine":726,"startColumn":41,"endLine":726,"endColumn":72},"calleeMethodHash":"109b51c126743896eda60a4e12d160a9","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.Theme.ThemeManager.GetThemeTypeFromTag(string)"},{"span":{"startLine":730,"startColumn":54,"endLine":730,"endColumn":77},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"StartsWith"},{"span":{"startLine":732,"startColumn":25,"endLine":737,"endColumn":27},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Add"},{"span":{"startLine":735,"startColumn":44,"endLine":735,"endColumn":71},"calleeMethodHash":"a70125d9ddb4a125c948c954bd0526a3","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.Theme.ThemeManager.GetPropertyPathFromTag(string)"},{"span":{"startLine":736,"startColumn":41,"endLine":736,"endColumn":65},"calleeMethodHash":"109b51c126743896eda60a4e12d160a9","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.Theme.ThemeManager.GetThemeTypeFromTag(string)"},{"span":{"startLine":742,"startColumn":17,"endLine":742,"endColumn":59},"calleeMethodHash":"3a7a355d4d77c36638c23e4e0031bbcf","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.Theme.ThemeManager.FindThemedChildren(DependencyObject, System.Collections.Generic.List\u003CAimmy2.Theme.ThemeManager.ThemeElementInfo\u003E)"}]},"lines":["        private static void FindThemedChildren(DependencyObject parent, List\u003CThemeElementInfo\u003E elementInfoList)","        {","            if (parent == null) return;","","            int childCount = VisualTreeHelper.GetChildrenCount(parent);","            for (int i = 0; i \u003C childCount; i\u002B\u002B)","            {","                var child = VisualTreeHelper.GetChild(parent, i);","","                if (child is FrameworkElement fe)","                {","                    // Check for Theme attached property first","                    string themeValue = ThemeBehavior.GetTheme(fe);","                    if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(themeValue))","                    {","                        elementInfoList.Add(new ThemeElementInfo","                        {","                            Target = fe,","                            PropertyPath = GetPropertyPathFromTag(themeValue),","                            ThemeType = GetThemeTypeFromTag(themeValue)","                        });","                    }","                    // Then check regular Tag property","                    else if (fe.Tag is string tag \u0026\u0026 tag.StartsWith(\u0022Theme\u0022))","                    {","                        elementInfoList.Add(new ThemeElementInfo","                        {","                            Target = fe,","                            PropertyPath = GetPropertyPathFromTag(tag),","                            ThemeType = GetThemeTypeFromTag(tag)","                        });","                    }","                }","","                // Recurse","                FindThemedChildren(child, elementInfoList);","            }","        }"],"startLine":707}